Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:52:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] security(slides): fail closed for hosted ai media ipc

Mcode-hosted Slides has no approval/session-aware adapter for these independent original AI/media handlers. Keep the original handlers for standalone GenOffice and install readable denials for the eight Slides-only ai:* channels in hosted mode. Generic standalone AI IPC is unchanged.

Source-Repository: https://github.com/genspark-ai/genoffice

Upstream-Base: aba076cc9b292461cc419288ee555e524f6250e1

License: Apache-2.0 (repository LICENSE)
